  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "秋天，無論在哪個地方的秋季，總是讓人感到愉悅；然而，北國的秋卻特別清澈、寧靜，並帶著一絲悲涼。",
      "output_sha256": "2583d433ed279c9eec917964304f43aa02e5a1c1858a98a2f0cc35edc13d9730",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.542143,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ccc61c1c19cb65b0da85593011f28fdc57805a30f8eb3baa4e4f50bca0ece35b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2583d433ed279c9eec917964304f43aa02e5a1c1858a98a2f0cc35edc13d9730",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的不遠千里，要從杭州趕上青島，更要從青島趕上北平來的理由，也不過想飽嘗一嘗這“秋”，這故都的秋味。",
      "output_sha256": "ce4f22de4caeeaf46ba4a4f2c94c5da05642e5b0005ccd98786628b1eef0aca9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "ce4f22de4caeeaf46ba4a4f2c94c5da05642e5b0005ccd98786628b1eef0aca9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "江南，秋當然也是有的；但草木雕得慢，空氣來得潤，天的顏色顯得淡，並且又時常多雨而少風；一個人夾在蘇州上海杭州，或廈門香港廣州的市民中間，渾渾沌沌地過去，只能感到一點點清涼，秋的味，秋的色，秋的意境與姿態，總看不飽，嘗不透，賞玩不到十足。",
      "output_sha256": "0591107bb38604a3c1b8f6733685c8ec2c66a18cb05626725a2a0632e141b7fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "0591107bb38604a3c1b8f6733685c8ec2c66a18cb05626725a2a0632e141b7fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "秋並不是名花，也不是美酒，這種半開半醉的狀態，於欣賞秋之過程中顯得格外不合適。",
      "output_sha256": "dd8829ef5737c43a9d5262324140ed7cc60f2806e506eed06024b5cc6256aeb4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.661322,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1b8b5d1fd17c3eae38a4a7ac129932508c65e2bba70f2d63c50181a5d09b6aae"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dd8829ef5737c43a9d5262324140ed7cc60f2806e506eed06024b5cc6256aeb4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "距離北國的秋天已經十餘年，南方的每一個秋季，總會令我想起陶然亭的蘆葦、釣魚臺的柳影、西山的蟲鳴、玉泉的夜月和潭柘寺的鐘聲。",
      "output_sha256": "20df91d231afd865034ad88850921e6a59b5713aa78bb03ea7712aa41340cea6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.663177,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5,
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0192abd5e82b77edafbb82ebf1900cc983b45823391e84a60a8c96c908916322",
        "1fc5b46967ce74a8819930547ef6426652c563b2979917db0ee2b33ed9b794ba"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "20df91d231afd865034ad88850921e6a59b5713aa78bb03ea7712aa41340cea6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在北平即使不出門去罷，就是在皇城人海之中，租人家一椽破屋來住着，早晨起來，泡一碗濃茶、向院子一坐，你也能看得到很高很高的碧綠的天色，聽得到青天下馴鴿的飛聲。",
      "output_sha256": "0ff5b65f609d735af9daa3d6ee8b274db6829e43536a83321bf08d7d93be7869",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "0ff5b65f609d735af9daa3d6ee8b274db6829e43536a83321bf08d7d93be7869",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "從槐樹葉底，朝東細數着一絲一絲漏下來的日光，或在破壁腰中，靜對着象喇叭似的牽牛花（朝榮）的藍朵，自然而然地也能夠感覺到十分的秋意。",
      "output_sha256": "3feace54272e31d570a18c16cbc3cff0e81386de2e44fbd0f57d8dc0128b87cb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "3feace54272e31d570a18c16cbc3cff0e81386de2e44fbd0f57d8dc0128b87cb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "說到了牽牛花，我以爲以藍色或白色者爲佳，紫黑色次之，淡紅色最下。",
      "output_sha256": "499e35b0bd7ce748b786cb550f68f20b71db3dafe3f8c16181f0f9f2a4a09348",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "499e35b0bd7ce748b786cb550f68f20b71db3dafe3f8c16181f0f9f2a4a09348",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "最好，還要在牽牛花底，教長着幾根疏疏落落的尖細且長的秋草，使作陪襯。",
      "output_sha256": "1464a062eb9124f355e1a34a40a810b0d032cd3d558b4165661f8536b1ec5d00",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "1464a062eb9124f355e1a34a40a810b0d032cd3d558b4165661f8536b1ec5d00",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "北國的槐樹，亦是一種能喚起秋意的景象。",
      "output_sha256": "d71779296cddb8649c9e4711c930101ca5fa40bbd58433f9eadb78e1311a993f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.575781,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "050b24841ca2ed5174e1cf43df77dbf133327802f58880cbb6a116b24e2de9ed"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d71779296cddb8649c9e4711c930101ca5fa40bbd58433f9eadb78e1311a993f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "象花而又不是花的那一種落蕊，早晨起來，會鋪得滿地。",
      "output_sha256": "164522c728f2825919799ccfdb74d1c962adb91d9cc30123e5748b28d5e6da34",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "164522c728f2825919799ccfdb74d1c962adb91d9cc30123e5748b28d5e6da34",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "腳踏上去，聲音也沒有，氣味也沒有，只能感出一點點極微細極柔軟的觸覺。",
      "output_sha256": "5bfdcbfbd0f7883f1e35c134a4cdd72f13628461c84a7c8866f4b1342c7c1723",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "5bfdcbfbd0f7883f1e35c134a4cdd72f13628461c84a7c8866f4b1342c7c1723",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "掃街的人在樹影下掃過後，留下的掃帚痕跡，既細膩又清閒，潛意識中更添幾分落寞。",
      "output_sha256": "7674bc85b0f3c8262081f19ad0f8267a33ded4d53449864c27570e43b12894ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.513792,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9b0bb4c27688792a05170e02062c1fe1353526d3dc4f263b7c759fb720552ca6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7674bc85b0f3c8262081f19ad0f8267a33ded4d53449864c27570e43b12894ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "古人所言的「梧桐一葉而天下知秋」，恐怕正是在這些靜謐的角落裡。",
      "output_sha256": "b58c4e1b52e0ac127a8e54574e30c9f288e6dcc8d9824090a5c63b6736fce9b1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.513792,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9b0bb4c27688792a05170e02062c1fe1353526d3dc4f263b7c759fb720552ca6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b58c4e1b52e0ac127a8e54574e30c9f288e6dcc8d9824090a5c63b6736fce9b1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "秋蟬的衰弱的殘聲，更是北國的特產；因爲北平處處全長着樹，屋子又低，所以無論在什麼地方，都聽得見它們的啼唱。",
      "output_sha256": "2caf84dc45f0b34af50b8b3c1907bdb298fe2966a8a8e18fa86bf6606103656c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "2caf84dc45f0b34af50b8b3c1907bdb298fe2966a8a8e18fa86bf6606103656c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在南方是非要上郊外或山上去才聽得到的。",
      "output_sha256": "13b800d04d716e9e2c5a0a1e7fe866396a4ecb831e300a72dbfb70c52588fb2e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "13b800d04d716e9e2c5a0a1e7fe866396a4ecb831e300a72dbfb70c52588fb2e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這秋蟬的嘶叫，在北平可和蟋蟀耗子一樣，簡直象是家家戶戶都養在家裏的家蟲。",
      "output_sha256": "473edebc55cbf9cd2bd6f33907784d94f76a82d103e5e79d715be6bb909f4e11",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "473edebc55cbf9cd2bd6f33907784d94f76a82d103e5e79d715be6bb909f4e11",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "北方的秋雨似乎也比南方的更具韻味，來得奇特，情趣十足。",
      "output_sha256": "d8ce735cdd87d0609b8759d16f1ccef057201289b92f799f5710e3e9a12fa679",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.47443,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d9edd5c68fc47885dc20afc932a34bb7faae160b1a0bdd3f3384cdbf4316ee8c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d8ce735cdd87d0609b8759d16f1ccef057201289b92f799f5710e3e9a12fa679",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在灰沈沈的天底下，忽而來一陣涼風，便息列索落地下起雨來了。",
      "output_sha256": "aca69d5253098d07a7585059ecab92a9f6fde5478f548f75d85d6b9a3c462987",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "aca69d5253098d07a7585059ecab92a9f6fde5478f548f75d85d6b9a3c462987",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "雨過天晴，雲層漸漸向西移去，天空重新變得湛藍，陽光也露出了笑臉。",
      "output_sha256": "5e032bc02bb8af1f36f2325e09608df9940535d9216c436219f2f819cebfeb9a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.537207,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "768d3f6708326e6502bef6c56505bb1b2ccca484814a023d23fad55f5302d471"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5e032bc02bb8af1f36f2325e09608df9940535d9216c436219f2f819cebfeb9a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "穿著厚厚的青布單衣或夾襖的城市居民，叼著煙管，在雨後的斜橋影中，走到橋頭樹下，遇見熟人，便會以慢條斯理的語調，輕嘆著互相應答：",
      "output_sha256": "771bee083e3addecb070ebc1eebe75981679547b955da3763ea39adfee401454",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.537207,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "768d3f6708326e6502bef6c56505bb1b2ccca484814a023d23fad55f5302d471"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "771bee083e3addecb070ebc1eebe75981679547b955da3763ea39adfee401454",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21,
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“唉，天可真涼了─—”（這了字念得很高，拖得很長。）",
      "output_sha256": "7fb589d23e34a7033f9d252881d76b99f7ce9e610e47617823a0d4e4813f83b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "7fb589d23e34a7033f9d252881d76b99f7ce9e610e47617823a0d4e4813f83b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“可不是麼？",
      "output_sha256": "40ea48d0a4b67d504b2dc0393e72aec7ee0c59814834508361337a49018ae917",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "40ea48d0a4b67d504b2dc0393e72aec7ee0c59814834508361337a49018ae917",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一層秋雨一層涼了！”",
      "output_sha256": "7c38b9dc746667c9cbdc9e228dd8b844295d7cc400fd28d2707e5dfaeae88242",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c38b9dc746667c9cbdc9e228dd8b844295d7cc400fd28d2707e5dfaeae88242",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北方人念陣字，總老象是層字，平平仄仄起來，這唸錯的歧韻，倒來得正好。",
      "output_sha256": "b019d96761c2f7215600d9c9d53515c5f851c55be005d0c507679c7446002c2d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "b019d96761c2f7215600d9c9d53515c5f851c55be005d0c507679c7446002c2d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "北方的果樹，到秋來，也是一種奇景。",
      "output_sha256": "fdf054671c20e024954d2916e13de113160a8285a711296c7fa2b29986303edb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "fdf054671c20e024954d2916e13de113160a8285a711296c7fa2b29986303edb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第一是棗子樹；屋角，牆頭，茅房邊上，竈房門口，它都會一株株地長大起來。",
      "output_sha256": "4591604456398e2c042d6af15ceb3aa74cbea9c3eea457baf998493e7ef3e130",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "4591604456398e2c042d6af15ceb3aa74cbea9c3eea457baf998493e7ef3e130",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "象橄欖又象鴿蛋似的這棗子顆兒，在小橢圓形的細葉中間，顯出淡綠微黃的顏色的時候，正是秋的全盛時期；等棗樹葉落，棗子紅完，西北風就要起來了，北方便是塵沙灰土的世界，只有這棗子、柿子、葡萄，成熟到八九分的七八月之交，是北國的清秋的佳日，是一年之中最好也沒有的GoldenDays。",
      "output_sha256": "59912acab62f12595503d9a0aba55ae85f42e995cc263d0c02a2d35686ac905a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "59912acab62f12595503d9a0aba55ae85f42e995cc263d0c02a2d35686ac905a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有些批評家說，中國的文人學士，尤其是詩人，都帶着很濃厚的頹廢色彩，所以中國的詩文裏，頌讚秋的文字特別的多。",
      "output_sha256": "316ad783cbf370b9842d369aba0c9ad85c14967a92307357487b2400fa0ae838",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "316ad783cbf370b9842d369aba0c9ad85c14967a92307357487b2400fa0ae838",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但外國的詩人，又何嘗不然？",
      "output_sha256": "775e8f187dcc7ac27ead2d495e56033301927532fe554690ba5738af2ec6bc27",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "775e8f187dcc7ac27ead2d495e56033301927532fe554690ba5738af2ec6bc27",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我雖則外國詩文念得不多，也不想開出賬來，做一篇秋的詩歌散文鈔，但你若去一翻英德法意等詩人的集子，或各國的詩文的An-thology來，總能夠看到許多關於秋的歌頌與悲啼。",
      "output_sha256": "c96a133a3990af626bc41e4c1e2d54032c74d06fd1bf737af8b71b1aad05dfda",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "c96a133a3990af626bc41e4c1e2d54032c74d06fd1bf737af8b71b1aad05dfda",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "各著名的大詩人的長篇田園詩或四季詩裏，也總以關於秋的部分。",
      "output_sha256": "c0c6650363da8b107709f84d5e9bfd070179eaf9c9797957e28d03632edd360a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "c0c6650363da8b107709f84d5e9bfd070179eaf9c9797957e28d03632edd360a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "寫得最出色而最有味。",
      "output_sha256": "b547998c8352f369d1679115055c558e1beaa321525720f1189dda0b508eaa03",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "b547998c8352f369d1679115055c558e1beaa321525720f1189dda0b508eaa03",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "足見有感覺的動物，有情趣的人類，對於秋，總是一樣的能特別引起深沈，幽遠，嚴厲，蕭索的感觸來的。",
      "output_sha256": "e4fd569e1aecac2df6762257035680a33f8d6b09cba444fc298f6564186b1ae0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "e4fd569e1aecac2df6762257035680a33f8d6b09cba444fc298f6564186b1ae0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不僅是詩人，連那些被囚禁的囚犯，到了秋天，我想也一定會感受到一種無法自已的深情；秋對於人類，豈有國別之分，更無階級之別？",
      "output_sha256": "bd4bdeda6e19376d42fd0ca6f413ea529404c34899e5542bc27755f3a9b8c0c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.579661,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b2768a92d68b24e53291b604f69144c79140ef52a588c7b57a9fb74402030def"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bd4bdeda6e19376d42fd0ca6f413ea529404c34899e5542bc27755f3a9b8c0c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不過在中國，文字裏有一個“秋士”的成語，讀本里又有着很普遍的歐陽子的《秋聲》與蘇東坡的《赤壁賦》等，就覺得中國的文人，與秋的關係特別深了。",
      "output_sha256": "4cc33e821138e5790d41afd967d8f04c1e3d75c4b7034f64438612c5a77d0350",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "4cc33e821138e5790d41afd967d8f04c1e3d75c4b7034f64438612c5a77d0350",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，這秋的深刻滋味，尤其是中國的秋味，唯有在北方才能真正體會到。",
      "output_sha256": "a76aabb4d51faa67716023930737235573934dbf6cf788708505ed9491827634",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.602314,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "44611ba8009eced12730a26a2275bda3dab2571ba01b48bbb259d3963d241c75"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a76aabb4d51faa67716023930737235573934dbf6cf788708505ed9491827634",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "南國的秋天，當然也有其獨特之處，例如廿四橋的明月、錢塘江的秋潮、普陀山的涼霧、荔枝灣的殘荷等等，然而色彩卻不濃，回味更是短暫。",
      "output_sha256": "9518b91db9c61a2aa28ca1b9c2e17c81f7c4ada5d42057dd24357b398f332555",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.694238,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2e3081564f4bca84e3f52a43e4ea52611dd59515ba45394a25237ff3af9f0c0a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9518b91db9c61a2aa28ca1b9c2e17c81f7c4ada5d42057dd24357b398f332555",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "比起北國的秋來，正象是黃酒之與白乾，稀飯之與饃饃，鱸魚之與大蟹，黃犬之與駱駝。",
      "output_sha256": "81607e817abce49be7eb2d967b004c01399e281a5fc3c735010fe2d72704991b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "81607e817abce49be7eb2d967b004c01399e281a5fc3c735010fe2d72704991b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "若能留住北國的秋天，我願意將生命的三分之二折讓，換得一個三分之一的零頭。",
      "output_sha256": "5498aabff9430da12153ec157e9a4a0014e862c450e780f615f2905c994c7301",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.654352,
